{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id130137572"}, "name":{"label":"Matt73940552"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-04T15:11:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"483.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"14628405173"}, "title":{"label":"TOO FAR!!!!😡😡😡😡"}, "content":{"label":"Oct 2026: And our elevation charts?!?!?! Now you’ve crossed a line!!🤬🤬🤬🤬\n\nOct 2026: You take away our heart rate graphs, I take away a star💁‍♂️, let’s see what else you can manage to screw up.\n\nJune 2024: Did you seriously just take away the ability to see our total elapsed time?!😡\n\nDo I need to buy a desktop computer to create a new segment now?🤷‍♂️ Strava has consistently performed poorly on mobile devices. A lot of times links to Strava activities will not work on my phone. Sometimes links will take you to the app for a split second and then force you back to a website that doesn’t work. Help please! Also, can I please change my map units of measurement to feet? When I’m 80 hours into a peakbagging adventure I would prefer not to convert meters on your map to feet on my watch. Why isn’t that the default in countries where that is the default?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=426826309&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
